Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Eighth Episode\NThe Iron Lion\NIron Lion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Blinded, Sapphire is carried off by Mephisto,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.17,0:01:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but Hecate rescues her just in time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Meanwhile, on Sea Snake Island,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.88,0:02:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}she found the King and Queen had been  turned to stone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire fell into the sea while trying to save the King and the others,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but was rescued by Pirate Blood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.35,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She now heads to the Waterfall of Purification to heal her eyes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.63,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With her sight restored by the Purification Waterfall,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.26,0:02:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire sets sail for Coolland to finally face the Snow Queen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, please sit back and enjoy today's episode: "The Iron Lion."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Snake Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sea Snake Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.39,0:03:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want so badly to go to Sea Snake Island and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But what good would it do if I went now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Without Mephisto's power, I can't turn you back into humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more urgent is exposing the Snow Queen's plot here in Coolland...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.70,0:04:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...and protecting Silverland as its princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, Father, Mother... I know you must be lonely, but please wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.09,0:04:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please watch over me, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.87,0:04:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't lose to the likes of the Snow Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, we'll take this as an offering for Queen Icicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you take that, we can't do business!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.22,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Icicle is waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"For the Snow Queen," they say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.63,0:06:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, noon, and night, they come and seize our precious goods!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How much is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How much, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... you're not from the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Knight of the Ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my! Well, step right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheapest prices around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The best snacks in Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I were from the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.57,0:06:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Queen's servants never pay us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Grandpa and everyone are always struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.70,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak ill of the Queen, and those nasty soldiers will arrest you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.43,0:07:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So speaking ill of—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! You know the castle decree, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens if you speak ill of the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,P-P-Please, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a slip of the tongue, I didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.43,0:07:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot change the laws of the great Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, you have nothing to apologize for!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Isn't it obvious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.49,0:07:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ribbon Knight will take you on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Our hero is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get those Coolland soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.28,0:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to hear me badmouth the Queen, I'll say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The Snow Queen is an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A total dimwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster-face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because people call her the Ribbon Knight, she gets all full of herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.55,0:08:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Coolland soldiers look tough, but they're so weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him, dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about an exaggeration!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like an actual war!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.97,0:09:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the man in the black cloak and Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Madame Freeze, let's set the trap right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to the market immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Ribbon Knight returns, act natural and spy on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.61,0:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep a close watch on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.78,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Madame Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:09:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That man was from the market...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.44,0:10:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So the castle has spies even in places like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why they find out right away whenever someone badmouths the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.84,0:10:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help worrying about the Ribbon Knight's identity at such a critical time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.43,0:10:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That new weapon was just completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A new weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. So the Iron Li-...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off to go check on it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.82,0:10:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear henchmen, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me to this new weapon of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Ribbon Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing. It's a mountain of barrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all wine from the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought it from the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the new weapon is down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,To think there was such a grand tunnel underground...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.26,0:11:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This hunk of iron?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called an armored car.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come ride with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight of the Ribbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared? Hardly! This will take us to the new weapon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm getting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face looks familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.04,0:12:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone like you before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you found the Knight of the Ribbon yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he has wings, he couldn't have escaped this valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.32,0:14:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Search!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Search!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.62,0:14:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Freeze. Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear the Iron Lion I've been looking forward to is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,May I see it right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Freeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it out and show me its invincible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming, coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope the Ribbon Knight doesn't show up at the wrong time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What a magnificent lion form!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed. Well done, Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.49,0:16:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And how powerful is this Iron Lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.99,0:16:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the hole in the lion's forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Steam power shoots 100 stone arrows from it in a single blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant crossbow, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It can crumble any castle wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.83,0:16:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us test it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Test it, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Line up the prisoners under that cliff and collapse it on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just collapsing it would be boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A weapon's true value is shown only when it takes human life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.18,0:16:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So let it assist with the executions while we're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.23,0:16:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Line up the laziest ones immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.66,0:16:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.14,0:17:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The steam is starting to vent now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight of the Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight of the Ribbon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.57,0:17:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, why are you in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was tricked and put on a prisoner train!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to test our iron magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.02,0:17:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot the stone arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What incredible power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.51,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That must have blown the Ribbon Knight to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so... He wouldn't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse that wretched Ribbon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.42,0:18:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they know my true power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers, hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pledge your swords to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight for the Queen of Coolland!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is always watching over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and show them our kingdom's strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, Silverland is in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cross this hill, and as we head down, charge all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire they're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them enter Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.85,0:20:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, please protect us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This arrow will decide the fate of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:20:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's turning back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you all doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.22,0:21:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, push forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They're falling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.60,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We beat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.67,0:21:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.03,0:22:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.53,0:22:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you already gone back to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.45,0:22:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.11,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.70,0:22:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.32,0:22:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking everywhere for you, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.61,0:22:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother and father are in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.65,0:22:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.10,0:22:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad is so angry, he's going to smash the stone statues to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.52,0:22:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.28,0:22:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't calm down unless you come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.24,0:22:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, take me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you go, your boy's heart will be taken...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.23,0:22:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.18,0:22:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So please guide me, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.18,0:23:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. If you insist, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.72,0:23:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Has Tink, Sapphire's closest friend, really passed away?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.98,0:23:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What will become of Sapphire, now targeted by Mephisto and the Queen of Coolland?{\i0}
